Specifies recommended modular discharge coefficients (CDe), head correction factors (kh), and standard uncertainties based on three standard crest cross-slopes (as shown in Table 4):
a) Slope 1:40 or less: CDe = 0.630 (or 0.625), kh = 0.0004 m (0.4 mm), Uncertainty = 1.25%;
b) Slope 1:20: CDe = 0.625 (or 0.620), kh = 0.0005 m (0.5 mm), Uncertainty = 1.4%;
c) Slope 1:10: CDe = 0.620 (or 0.615), kh = 0.0008 m (0.8 mm), Uncertainty = 1.15%.
